<title>GERMANY: TABLE-New Bavaria bank details proforma 96 figures.</title>
<headline>TABLE-New Bavaria bank details proforma 96 figures.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's fourth- and fifth-largest banks, Bayerische Vereinsbank and Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechselbank, said on Monday they were joining forces to form Bayerische Hypo- und Vereinsbank AG.</p>
<p>The two banks released the following pro forma merged</p>
<p>balance sheet for 1996 at a news conference to announce the</p>
<p>merger plans.</p>
